Upstream-Name: claude-code
Upstream-Contact: Anthropic <support@anthropic.com>
Source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup
Comment:
 This package contains no part of Claude Code. Anthropic publishes Claude
 Code as a proprietary binary -- the npm package records its licence as
 "SEE LICENSE IN README.md", and that README names the Anthropic Commercial
 Terms of Service, which grant no right to redistribute it. So the package
 ships only the digests of a release and a maintainer script that downloads
 that release from Anthropic's own service onto the machine installing it.
 .
 Whoever installs this package receives Claude Code directly from Anthropic
 and under Anthropic's terms:
 .
   https://www.anthropic.com/legal/commercial-terms
   https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy
   https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup
 .
 Claude Code sends the contents of the files it is pointed at to Anthropic in
 order to work, and collects usage data; see
 https://code.claude.com/docs/en/data-usage.

